{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e8531f5b-c5e9-80f2-8efe-2a7ba63a693b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T14:51:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Thomas Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:49:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I need to get a dog license. Got a new puppy and somebody told me I have to have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:49:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, congratulations! A puppy, how fun. Yes, dogs do need to be licensed here. What kind is he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beagle mix, I think. Look, I just want to know what it costs and how I do it. Seems like every little thing needs a form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:49:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. You can come in to the clerk's office with proof of his rabies vaccination, and we'll get it set up. If he's too young for the shot yet, bring whatever the vet gave you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Proof of the rabies vaccination. Okay. And the fee? What's the fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee depends on whether he's been spayed or neutered, so it's a little different. I'd rather you hear the exact amount when you come in or from the counter staff than have me quote it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Depends on whether he's fixed. He's not, he's twelve weeks. Wonderful. Fine. And how long is it good for once I pay it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a license you renew, so it runs for a set period and then you do it again. The counter will tell you the exact dates when you get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Renew, so it expires. Great. Another thing to remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, I know. Are you at the house on Callender?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ninety-five Callender Avenue, yeah. North End. Sorry if I sound short, I was up at the crack of dawn to watch the parade rehearsal and I'm beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's an early one! Well, come by whenever you're ready, the office is open until close today, and bring that vet paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Vet paper. Got it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T14:50:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Peckham. Enjoy that puppy."
    }
  ],
